interest-relay
Copyright 2026 Lightweb Inc. (https://lightweb.net)

=========================================================================

This software is a small standalone daemon that relays topic interest: it
holds the union of the interest announced by the hosts and relays below it
and announces that union to its own upstreams, as far as the multicast
delivery edge that serves the consumer.

